1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,768
A plane wavefront of wavelength lambda falls on a slit A B of width a.

2
00:00:05,768 --> 00:00:10,716
By Huygens, every point across the slit sends out secondary wavelets.

3
00:00:10,716 --> 00:00:13,580
Pick the ones that leave at some angle theta.

4
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:17,070
A lens will bring them all to one point P on the screen.

